{"c":{"191539":["Ron Kamonohashi","Male","b191539-PVJMQzFigVmN.png","A talented detective and the student with the highest grades in Detective Training Academy BLUE's history. As his detective license was revoked after an incident five years ago, he has partnered up with Totomaru Isshiki to still be able to solve cases.",806],"193587":["Totomaru Isshiki","Male","b193587-mrp6xN2rADbt.png","Totomaru Isshiki, frequently shortened to Toto, is a police detective of the Metropolitan Police Department. He helps Ron Kamonohashi investigate cases by pretending to be the one who solves them.",145],"249191":["Mofu Usaki","Female","b249191-on5lUnpSuDLr.png","Mofu Usaki is world-renowned neurosurgeon who does surgeries on a microscopic scale and undertakes at least 800 surgeries a year. She also stars in the liveshow \"Lie or Truth? ESP!!\"",60],"249192":["Amamiya","Female","b249192-qfGTE8UxemI9.png","Amamiya is the leader of the First Investigative Division of the Metropolitan Police Department and Totomaru Isshiki's superior.",44],"249193":["Spitz Fire","Male","b249193-7JB5Lv1mtyee.png","Tracking instructor at B.L.U.E",55],"249194":["Chikori Monki","Female","b249194-jVQsQaRpVrpO.png","A crime reporter at Lime Weekly.",10],"249195":["Omito Kawasemi","Male","b249195-LLwb349gbggG.png","A police detective at the Aichi Prefectural Police and the detective with the highest number of solved cases in the entire country. Because of this, he is already considered for police superintendent general.",33],"249196":["Eme Emmerich","Female","b249196-zKnJowJ4a2Sy.png","Eme Emmerich is the headmistress of Detective Training Academy BLUE and an old friend of Ron Kamonohashi's parents.",1],"249197":["Winter Moriarty",null,"b249197-Mie69XE6SxrZ.png","Fourth child of the M. Family.",18],"249198":["Mylo Moriarty","Male","b249198-gy1EslStNJcx.png","Current head child and first child of the M. Family.",28],"316427":["Hirsch",null,"b316427-nRwPUKVBsAY1.png","",2],"316428":["Finn Fennec","Female","b316